#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:1
msgid "Convert FP4 and FP8 checkpoints to BF16"
msgstr "将 FP4 和 FP8 检查点转换为 BF16"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:3
msgid ""
"Convert source-quantized checkpoint weights to BF16 when you need a float"
" baseline or a runtime that does not consume the original FP4 or FP8 "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"当你需要浮点基线，或运行时无法使用原始 FP4 或 FP8 布局时，"
"请将源量化的检查点权重转换为 BF16。"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:7
msgid "Before conversion, prepare:"
msgstr "转换前，请准备："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:9
msgid "a local HuggingFace `safetensors` checkpoint directory"
msgstr "本地 HuggingFace `safetensors` 检查点目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:10
msgid "`config.json` and `model.safetensors.index.json` in the input directory"
msgstr "输入目录中的 `config.json` 和 `model.safetensors.index.json`"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:11
msgid "source weights in recognized MXFP4 or strict 128×128 block FP8 layout"
msgstr "采用可识别的 MXFP4 或严格 128×128 块 FP8 布局的源权重"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:12
msgid "a new empty output directory"
msgstr "新的空输出目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:15
msgid ""
"Do not use the input directory as the output directory. Conversion writes"
" a new checkpoint directory and must not mix with source shards."
msgstr ""
"不要将输入目录用作输出目录。转换会写入新的检查点目录，"
"不得与源分片混合。"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:18
msgid "Inspect the input"
msgstr "检查输入"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:20
msgid "Run inspection first:"
msgstr "先运行检查："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:26
msgid ""
"Confirm that the source contains recognized MXFP4 or block FP8 tensors. "
"If the input is already BF16, FP16, or FP32, conversion may have nothing "
"to do."
msgstr ""
"确认源包含可识别的 MXFP4 或块 FP8 张量。"
"如果输入已经是 BF16、FP16 或 FP32，转换可能无事可做。"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:28
msgid "Run a dry-run"
msgstr "运行 dry-run"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:30
msgid "Preview the conversion plan without writing weights:"
msgstr "在不写入权重的情况下预览转换计划："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:41
msgid "Check that:"
msgstr "检查以下事项："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:43
msgid "supported low-precision tensors are recognized"
msgstr "支持的低精度张量已被识别"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:44
msgid "output points to a new directory"
msgstr "输出指向新的目录"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:45
msgid "the selected backend is available or an intentional fallback is used"
msgstr "所选后端可用，或已使用有意选择的备用方案"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:47
msgid "Generate BF16 output"
msgstr "生成 BF16 输出"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:49
msgid "Remove `--dry-run` to write the converted checkpoint:"
msgstr "移除 `--dry-run` 以写入转换后的检查点："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:59
msgid "`--to` currently accepts `bf16`."
msgstr "`--to` 目前接受 `bf16`。"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:61
msgid "Validate the converted artifact"
msgstr "验证转换后的产物"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:63
msgid "Run validation after conversion:"
msgstr "转换后运行验证："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:69
msgid "Expected result:"
msgstr "预期结果："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:75
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:77
msgid ""
"The output directory contains BF16-compatible checkpoint shards, the "
"shard index, model configuration, tokenizer files, and conversion "
"metadata."
msgstr ""
"输出目录包含兼容 BF16 的检查点分片、分片索引、模型配置、"
"分词器文件和转换元数据。"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:79
msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "备用方案"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:81
msgid "If conversion reports that no supported FP4 or FP8 tensors were found:"
msgstr "如果转换报告未找到支持的 FP4 或 FP8 张量："

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:83
msgid "verify that the input is the intended low-precision source checkpoint"
msgstr "确认输入是预期的低精度源检查点"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:84
msgid "use `inspect` output to confirm detected formats"
msgstr "使用 `inspect` 输出确认检测到的格式"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:85
msgid ""
"treat already-float inputs as a float baseline instead of forcing "
"conversion"
msgstr ""
"将已经是浮点格式的输入视为浮点基线，而不是强制转换"

#: ../../source/how-to/convert-fp4-fp8-to-bf16.md:86
msgid "do not guess unknown low-precision layouts."
msgstr "不要猜测未知的低精度布局。"
